{
  "name": "M8 小練習① 學習筆記三點",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "name": "手動執行",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "<筆記>今天學了 n8n 的 Webhook。正式網址要 Publish 才有效。測試網址只在按下聽取時有效。標頭驗證錯會回 403，流程完全不會跑。</筆記>",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "你是學習小幫手。把 <筆記> 整理成剛好 3 點繁體中文重點，每點 30 字以內，只能用筆記裡有的內容。筆記太短或看不懂，points 留空、needsReview 設成 true。"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "整理筆記",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "name": "Gemini模型",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        160,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "fromJson",
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"points\": [\n    \"第一點\",\n    \"第二點\",\n    \"第三點\"\n  ],\n  \"needsReview\": false\n}"
      },
      "name": "格式解析器",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        320,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c0",
              "leftValue": "={{ !$json.output.needsReview && $json.output.points.length === 3 && $json.output.points.every(p => p.length <= 40) }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "三點都對嗎",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
